## An AttributeBegin inside ObjectBegin: a block request out of place, which stops the file.
## Read by tests/outofmode_test.cpp.
Display "outofmode_block.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 32 32 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.0] "from" [5 3 0] "to" [0 0 0]
ObjectBegin 1
AttributeBegin
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
AttributeEnd
ObjectEnd
WorldEnd
